abstract: >-
  Zero-consolidation multi-format scientific engineering stack unifying Clean-Slate v3.0
  micro-hardware runtime invariants (11-pool FP64 thermodynamic conservation, Philox4x32-10
  seed isolation, XPBD compliant soft hydrostats, 10x10x10 Hybrid Cube, hardware Ring-0 ACL)
  with macro evolutionary metrology (OVBS-52, 78-alert ALifeOps YAML, 748-run paired empirical
  falsification, 5-engine native verification totaling 244 Lean 4 theorems plus 36 local
  zero-Mathlib Lean 4.35.0 package theorems = 280 Pure Lean 4 theorems, and a 1,900-problem
  Mega-Atlas non-retirement audit).
